# Copy this file to ".autogit-agent" (drop the .example) in the ROOT of any repo
# you want the agent pipeline to fully process: commit → PR → review → merge.
#
# The file is sourced as shell, so it may be empty (use all defaults) or set:

# BASE_BRANCH=main               # PR target; default = origin's default branch
# MERGE_METHOD=squash            # squash | merge | rebase
# CLAUDE_FLAGS="--dangerously-skip-permissions"   # how the headless agent runs
